OL,3,GNEWSAWork on new leisure centre and
OL,4,Acouncil HQ begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to create a new leisure centre and
OL,7,Fcouncil headquarters in Derbyshire has
OL,8,Fstarted.
OL,10,FThe new centre and South Derbyshire
OL,11,FDistrict Council office is being built
OL,12,Fon the former Cadley colliery site in
OL,13,FSwadlincote.
OL,15,FApproved by the council in June, the
OL,16,Fcentre will include a 25m (82ft)
OL,17,Fswimming pool with a movable floor, a
OL,18,Fsauna, therapy gym equipment, a
OL,19,F150-piece fitness suite, cafe,
OL,20,Fsix-court sports hall and 383 parking
OL,21,Fspaces.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
