OL,3,GNEWSAWork on new leisure centre and
OL,4,Acouncil HQ begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FConstruction of the facility, which
OL,7,Fwill cost #188m over a 50-year loan,
OL,8,Fwas due to begin in September and is
OL,9,Fnow expected to be completed by the end
OL,10,Fof 2028.
